DUSD::setFlashFee
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── given caller is owner
│   ├── when setting flash fee to zero
│   │   ├── it should set flashFee to zero
│   │   └── it should emit SetFlashFee event with old and new fee
│   ├── when setting flash fee to non-zero value
│   │   ├── it should set flashFee to the new value
│   │   └── it should emit SetFlashFee event with old and new fee
│   └── when setting flash fee to same value
│       ├── it should update flashFee to the same value
│       └── it should emit SetFlashFee event with old and new fee
